---
source: crates/pgt-ddl/src/build/domain.rs
expression: render(&pl)
---
[Safe] ALTER DOMAIN public.d RENAME TO d2
[Safe] ALTER DOMAIN public.d2 SET SCHEMA app
[Safe] ALTER DOMAIN app.d2 DROP DEFAULT
[Safe] ALTER DOMAIN app.d2 DROP NOT NULL
[Safe] ALTER DOMAIN app.d2 RENAME CONSTRAINT a TO a2
[Destructive] ALTER DOMAIN app.d2 DROP CONSTRAINT b  -- ifade değişti: kısıt kaldırılıp yeniden eklenir
[Destructive] ALTER DOMAIN app.d2 DROP CONSTRAINT d
[Safe] ALTER DOMAIN app.d2 ADD CONSTRAINT b CHECK (VALUE < 20
)  -- kullanan kolonları tarar
[Safe] ALTER DOMAIN app.d2 ADD CONSTRAINT e CHECK (VALUE <> 7
)  -- kullanan kolonları tarar
[Safe] ALTER DOMAIN app.d2 VALIDATE CONSTRAINT c
[Safe] COMMENT ON DOMAIN app.d2 IS NULL
[Safe] ALTER DOMAIN app.d2 OWNER TO r
